-- $F_i$: Feature map extracted from image $I_i$ using the shared CNN. Dimensions: $H \times W \times C$ [S1].
-- $f_i$: Local feature vector at 2D coordinate $u_i$ in $F_i$. Dimensions: $C$ [S1].
